  "question": "Where can I find an attraction in the north direction of Shavers Creek Environmental Center, Petersburg, PA, limited to 160 kilometers?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.909905 40.667715)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.909905 40.667715)',4326)::geography, 160000)\nAND tourism = 'attraction'\nAND ((degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 0.0 AND 22.5) OR (degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360));\n",
